WEBVTT

00:01:47.590 --> 00:01:48.830
This is the end!

00:02:02.750 --> 00:02:03.510
He did it!

00:02:04.370 --> 00:02:06.640
He did it! He saved us!

00:02:13.880 --> 00:02:15.540
What the squid does that mean?

00:02:16.250 --> 00:02:19.320
What does he mean by "This is the end"?

00:02:19.510 --> 00:02:24.330
<b>Who's Up For A Squid-vasion?!</b>

00:02:24.830 --> 00:02:28.020
That was... such a sad movie.

00:02:28.650 --> 00:02:30.710
For such courageous invaders

00:02:30.710 --> 00:02:33.590
to meet such a senseless defeat...

00:02:33.590 --> 00:02:35.010
Get to work.

00:02:35.460 --> 00:02:38.720
But those invaders were 
squidding stupid, too!

00:02:38.720 --> 00:02:40.470
The whole thing was a 
little half-hearted!

00:02:40.710 --> 00:02:43.780
If you're going to talk about half-hearted,  
just look in the mirror.

00:02:45.300 --> 00:02:49.690
<i>I am going to use this house as a base
to squidly subdue humanity!</i>

00:02:49.880 --> 00:02:52.520
That's what you said anyway, 
so what are you doing here?

00:02:53.300 --> 00:02:54.980
I have no squidding choice!

00:02:55.650 --> 00:02:58.940
Every day, you and Chizuru force 
me to help at the Lemon House,

00:02:59.400 --> 00:03:01.660
or to do other chores,
like cleaning the bath tub.

00:03:02.090 --> 00:03:04.730
You guys are the ones getting in my way!

00:03:05.110 --> 00:03:06.300
Idiot.

00:03:06.300 --> 00:03:08.290
That's your responsibility 
as a freeloader.

00:03:09.340 --> 00:03:12.420
Once your work is done,
all you do is sit around playing video games,

00:03:12.420 --> 00:03:16.970
reading manga, and otherwise being half-hearted.

00:03:16.970 --> 00:03:18.930
At this rate I'd say your chances of 
invading anything are zero.

00:03:19.750 --> 00:03:21.590
That's not true!

00:03:22.320 --> 00:03:25.510
You underestimate my terrifying
squid powers, Eiko!

00:03:26.600 --> 00:03:29.990
Then why don't you get back to your 
invasion activities right now?

00:03:29.990 --> 00:03:30.890
Huh?

00:03:31.060 --> 00:03:32.210
Why don't you

00:03:32.210 --> 00:03:33.950
go back to the sea and pick a fight 
with a shark, or something?

00:03:34.280 --> 00:03:35.720
I'd die.

00:03:36.120 --> 00:03:38.270
Or you could pick a fight 
with my older sister.

00:03:38.790 --> 00:03:40.530
I'd die even more!

00:03:40.920 --> 00:03:43.990
I guess a peaceful life is where it's at.

00:03:44.430 --> 00:03:45.980
I'm going back to work.

00:03:48.170 --> 00:03:50.400
She summed me up a squiddle too easily.

00:03:51.460 --> 00:03:54.250
I can't go on like this!

00:03:54.840 --> 00:03:57.670
This time I must overcome all obstacles

00:03:57.670 --> 00:04:01.740
and begin a new plan for squid-vasion!

00:04:03.560 --> 00:04:04.640
Still...

00:04:04.640 --> 00:04:08.710
I guess all I can do right now 
is pick up the trash

00:04:08.710 --> 00:04:10.520
the humans threw on the beach.

00:04:11.960 --> 00:04:12.660
Huh?

00:04:12.660 --> 00:04:14.060
Squid Girlie!

00:04:14.060 --> 00:04:15.980
Oh, hey Takeru.

00:04:16.280 --> 00:04:17.770
Can you grab that ball?

00:04:18.370 --> 00:04:20.650
Oh... sure!

00:04:22.160 --> 00:04:25.530
Wait, isn't this actually a ball-shaped bomb?!

00:04:26.240 --> 00:04:28.240
Thanks, Squid Gi-- Hey!

00:04:32.050 --> 00:04:33.910
I ink it was a fake.

00:04:33.910 --> 00:04:35.210
I wasn't expecting that.

00:04:35.870 --> 00:04:38.600
Neither were we!

00:04:39.650 --> 00:04:42.000
I've eliminated one of my obstacles.

00:04:42.390 --> 00:04:43.840
I'm glad I found you here.

00:04:44.650 --> 00:04:49.080
Can I interview you about the 
daily life of a Squidian?

00:04:49.380 --> 00:04:51.390
You can ask me questions about
my squid-vasion activities.

00:04:51.910 --> 00:04:54.310
Then I'll be recording this,
 if you don't mind.

00:04:55.900 --> 00:04:58.550
That might very well be 
a new weapon developed

00:04:58.550 --> 00:05:00.570
by the lab's Three Stooges!

00:05:07.690 --> 00:05:08.960
Yahoo!

00:05:08.960 --> 00:05:10.710
Let's dissect the invader!

00:05:10.710 --> 00:05:11.790
Anatomy!

00:05:14.800 --> 00:05:16.770
I still have to pay this off!

00:05:18.160 --> 00:05:20.250
That was too squidding close.

00:05:21.820 --> 00:05:22.870
With all this going on,

00:05:22.870 --> 00:05:25.410
I don't even know if I can trust
my own home base.

00:05:29.380 --> 00:05:31.720
Doesn't look like anything is amiss.

00:05:36.890 --> 00:05:37.600
That...

00:05:38.040 --> 00:05:40.210
That's about to blow!

00:05:41.150 --> 00:05:42.210
Get down!

00:05:47.720 --> 00:05:49.740
Don't tell me that was another fake!

00:05:50.780 --> 00:05:53.030
I have to stay on my tentacles!

00:05:53.560 --> 00:05:55.150
Hello, Squiddie!

00:05:56.400 --> 00:05:57.820
Can I take a video of you?

00:05:58.020 --> 00:05:59.630
She's sprinting away from me?

00:06:00.880 --> 00:06:03.250
Sanae is 100% dangerous, 
no doubt about it.

00:06:03.770 --> 00:06:05.000
Whoops!

00:06:05.530 --> 00:06:06.440
Goro?

00:06:06.710 --> 00:06:09.110
And... who are you?

00:06:09.460 --> 00:06:11.780
Isozaki. Tatsuo Isozaki!

00:06:12.750 --> 00:06:14.770
We've met many times!

00:06:15.550 --> 00:06:19.270
We were on our way to 
Chizuru's to get some lunch.

00:06:19.820 --> 00:06:21.930
Come join us if you're free.

00:06:21.930 --> 00:06:23.760
You can get a shrimp pilaf, my treat.

00:06:24.370 --> 00:06:25.440
Shrimp!

00:06:27.900 --> 00:06:29.240
Why would Goro want to treat me?

00:06:29.240 --> 00:06:30.320
That's pretty suspicious.

00:06:30.680 --> 00:06:34.490
You always try to show 
off in front of Chizuru.

00:06:34.490 --> 00:06:36.190
What are you talking about?

00:06:36.190 --> 00:06:38.290
Of course not!

00:06:39.780 --> 00:06:42.900
Shrimp, shrimp! Squidliedee, squidliedoo!

00:06:50.400 --> 00:06:52.700
Only a squiddle coward would use poison!

00:06:54.450 --> 00:06:56.300
Sorry to disappoint you,

00:06:56.630 --> 00:06:59.820
but your cheap tricks 
won't work with me!

00:06:59.820 --> 00:07:02.720
Lemon House by the Sea is mine!

00:07:02.920 --> 00:07:03.810
Hey!

00:07:04.240 --> 00:07:07.600
It looks like the 
danger's all around me.

00:07:09.010 --> 00:07:13.500
I really am like an invader 
facing all kinds of resistance!

00:07:14.610 --> 00:07:16.400
That's right!

00:07:20.690 --> 00:07:22.600
Just like I thought!

00:07:22.600 --> 00:07:24.830
Everyone thinks I'm an invader

00:07:24.830 --> 00:07:27.160
and looks upon me with fear!

00:07:28.810 --> 00:07:29.630
That's...

00:07:29.630 --> 00:07:31.800
The invader's favorite 
food: Shrimp pilaf!

00:07:32.680 --> 00:07:34.260
Squid-vasion!

00:07:37.580 --> 00:07:38.930
What the hell are you doing?

00:07:41.370 --> 00:07:43.240
The counterattack begins!

00:07:49.330 --> 00:07:50.490
Delicious!

00:07:51.880 --> 00:07:54.430
Now it's my turn.

00:07:54.740 --> 00:07:55.910
Like they say in those invasion movies:

00:07:56.580 --> 00:07:58.660
Let the squid-vasion begin!

00:08:00.540 --> 00:08:02.950
Squids away!

00:08:07.680 --> 00:08:08.950
Oww...

00:08:08.950 --> 00:08:10.110
Hey, who the squid was that?

00:08:10.110 --> 00:08:11.210
I could've really hurt--

00:08:11.210 --> 00:08:13.680
You can't go on a rampage 
in the restaurant.

00:08:14.200 --> 00:08:17.060
Y-y-yes ma'am.

00:08:22.080 --> 00:08:24.690
I'm very sorry.

00:08:25.860 --> 00:08:28.410
I apologize for the disturbance!

00:08:28.410 --> 00:08:30.990
Another shrimp pilaf is on the way!

00:08:39.170 --> 00:08:43.750
This brings to a close 
my first plan for squid-vasion!

00:08:44.220 --> 00:08:46.400
You never even started...

00:08:48.980 --> 00:08:51.430
Lemon

00:08:49.790 --> 00:08:51.430
Ramen, please!

00:08:51.430 --> 00:08:52.630
Excuse me!

00:08:53.290 --> 00:08:54.530
Could I have some water?

00:08:54.530 --> 00:08:55.260
Coming up!

00:08:55.390 --> 00:08:56.990
Check please.

00:08:57.290 --> 00:08:58.180
All right!

00:08:58.180 --> 00:08:59.640
One moment, please.

00:09:00.780 --> 00:09:01.850
Excuse me...

00:09:01.850 --> 00:09:02.520
Yes?

00:09:04.220 --> 00:09:05.320
Kiyomi!

00:09:06.630 --> 00:09:11.480
<b>Ink That's A Love Rival?!</b>

00:09:11.780 --> 00:09:14.370
You haven't been here in many tides!

00:09:14.630 --> 00:09:15.600
Yeah, huh?

00:09:15.790 --> 00:09:17.370
It's a little embarrassing.

00:09:17.570 --> 00:09:20.780
Our special today is Chizuru's 
Anything Goes Curry.

00:09:21.320 --> 00:09:22.400
If you're thinking dessert,

00:09:22.400 --> 00:09:24.540
how about a red bean ice with sweet syrup?

00:09:26.390 --> 00:09:28.450
Can I order a little later?

00:09:28.670 --> 00:09:31.000
I actually came because the club...

00:09:29.390 --> 00:09:31.000
Excuse me, the water...

00:09:32.780 --> 00:09:36.010
Squid Girl, why don't you talk to her later?

00:09:36.290 --> 00:09:37.480
You're right.

00:09:37.480 --> 00:09:38.990
Just wait right here!

00:09:39.210 --> 00:09:40.500
Sure. I'll wait.

00:09:43.760 --> 00:09:46.070
Kiyomi's a really nice girl.

00:09:46.600 --> 00:09:50.980
But I was hoping she'd stay 
away from this restaurant...

00:09:51.540 --> 00:09:54.600
Since Sanae's here.

00:09:55.600 --> 00:09:58.240
Eiko, who's that girl?

00:09:58.570 --> 00:10:00.740
She seemed pretty friendly with Squiddie.

00:10:01.010 --> 00:10:03.790
Why don't you take care 
of that nasty aura first?

00:10:04.660 --> 00:10:06.770
She's Squid Girl's friend.

00:10:06.770 --> 00:10:08.960
Remember? You met her at 
the beach volleyball tournament.

00:10:09.260 --> 00:10:12.150
I'm sorry, but I can't see 
anyone but Squiddie.

00:10:12.420 --> 00:10:13.420
I bet.

00:10:14.650 --> 00:10:15.740
Squiddie...

00:10:15.740 --> 00:10:18.120
Why are you messing around

00:10:18.120 --> 00:10:20.920
with another girl when you have me?!

00:10:20.920 --> 00:10:22.960
Don't say it in such a creepy way.

00:10:23.150 --> 00:10:25.350
This time it's a real problem!

00:10:26.460 --> 00:10:27.870
When it was Nagisa, it was

00:10:27.870 --> 00:10:30.440
salvageable because she 
was scared of Squiddie,

00:10:31.080 --> 00:10:34.230
but these two look like 
they're really close!

00:10:34.670 --> 00:10:39.740
<b>Easy-to-Read Table of Squiddie's Favorites</b>

00:10:35.120 --> 00:10:38.420
Right now, it looks like this girl 
is ranked the highest.

00:10:39.140 --> 00:10:41.290
This is bad.

00:10:42.200 --> 00:10:43.360
Hey, Squid Girl.

00:10:43.670 --> 00:10:45.770
Why don't you leave early today,

00:10:45.770 --> 00:10:47.290
since Kiyomi's come all the way to see you?

00:10:48.260 --> 00:10:49.370
I ink I will!

00:10:50.000 --> 00:10:51.570
How could she!

00:10:51.820 --> 00:10:53.500
What, what... then?

00:10:53.500 --> 00:10:55.780
You're saying the traitor was
right here the whole time?

00:10:58.520 --> 00:11:02.160
I tried to get her away from Sanae 
for Kiyomi's safety,

00:11:02.160 --> 00:11:03.680
but maybe I just made it worse!

00:11:04.380 --> 00:11:05.600
Let's wait a bit though.

00:11:06.030 --> 00:11:08.110
The others will be here soon.

00:11:08.590 --> 00:11:09.590
Others?

00:11:10.120 --> 00:11:11.440
There you are!

00:11:11.900 --> 00:11:15.160
You shouldn't have left 
without us like that, captain.

00:11:15.470 --> 00:11:17.650
It's been a long time, Senior Squid Girl!

00:11:18.150 --> 00:11:19.450
They're multiplying!

00:11:19.890 --> 00:11:21.130
Who are these girls?

00:11:21.530 --> 00:11:23.570
They're members of Kiyomi's club!

00:11:23.950 --> 00:11:25.070
Hello.

00:11:25.390 --> 00:11:26.420
It's nice to meet you.

00:11:27.540 --> 00:11:29.210
They look up to you, huh?

00:11:30.180 --> 00:11:33.770
I didn't know she had these friends...

00:11:34.340 --> 00:11:35.710
I made a mistake.

00:11:35.710 --> 00:11:37.970
The competition is growing even more!

00:11:39.770 --> 00:11:41.150
No, no, no.

00:11:41.360 --> 00:11:42.850
You have to calm down, Sanae.

00:11:44.780 --> 00:11:47.300
Gather your intel first.

00:11:48.190 --> 00:11:51.790
Senior Squid Girl, next time, let's go to 
that bakery by the train station!

00:11:52.240 --> 00:11:53.940
I love that place!

00:11:54.520 --> 00:11:55.980
If we go with more than four people,

00:11:55.980 --> 00:11:57.950
we can order the Giant Parfait!

00:11:57.950 --> 00:11:59.080
Yeah!

00:12:00.150 --> 00:12:02.060
Do you like sweets, Squiddie?

00:12:02.550 --> 00:12:04.160
I like shrimp!

00:12:04.750 --> 00:12:06.300
Shrimp, huh...

00:12:06.530 --> 00:12:09.950
Well, I know a place that makes a 
really good Shrimp Fry Sandwich!

00:12:09.950 --> 00:12:11.600
A Shrimp Fry Sandwich?

00:12:11.600 --> 00:12:14.120
Just the name already sounds delicious!

00:12:14.660 --> 00:12:16.820
Then we could have the 
sandwich for lunch.

00:12:16.820 --> 00:12:19.570
Then, we'll go shopping and 
have the parfait for a snack!

00:12:19.570 --> 00:12:20.850
Great idea!

00:12:21.800 --> 00:12:22.960
That reminds me!

00:12:23.190 --> 00:12:25.640
I wanted to go shopping for new sandals.

00:12:26.070 --> 00:12:27.870
I'd like you to pick them out for me!

00:12:28.220 --> 00:12:30.270
Are you sure you're okay with that?

00:12:30.580 --> 00:12:31.390
Yes!

00:12:31.390 --> 00:12:32.180
So please...

00:12:35.260 --> 00:12:36.130
Umm...

00:12:36.360 --> 00:12:37.780
Can I help you?

00:12:40.480 --> 00:12:42.400
I am not a suspicious person!

00:12:42.400 --> 00:12:45.810
I wasn't trying to eavesdrop 
on your conversation or anything!

00:12:45.810 --> 00:12:46.740
Not at all!

00:12:47.010 --> 00:12:51.160
I was just interested in... 
Well, you could say...

00:12:51.850 --> 00:12:52.710
I wanted to know...

00:12:53.290 --> 00:12:55.220
So, umm... well...

00:12:55.220 --> 00:12:57.940
I... that's it!

00:12:57.940 --> 00:13:00.620
My name is Sanae Nagatsuki.

00:13:00.620 --> 00:13:02.300
and I love Squiddie!

00:13:05.970 --> 00:13:08.640
I freaked them out!

00:13:10.230 --> 00:13:12.220
I'm Kiyomi Sakura.

00:13:12.470 --> 00:13:13.940
I'm Tomomi Mochizuki.

00:13:14.240 --> 00:13:15.560
My name is Yuka Nishimura.

00:13:16.160 --> 00:13:17.560
I'm Ayano Watanabe.

00:13:18.290 --> 00:13:21.110
Wait... aren't you going 
to make fun of me?

00:13:21.860 --> 00:13:23.090
Why?

00:13:23.530 --> 00:13:25.990
I mean, I blurted out that I like her.

00:13:26.790 --> 00:13:28.650
But we love...

00:13:29.890 --> 00:13:31.560
...Senior Squid Girl too!

00:13:33.030 --> 00:13:36.420
She claims to be an invader, 
but she never does anything bad.

00:13:36.420 --> 00:13:37.450
She's right!

00:13:37.640 --> 00:13:39.770
She makes friends easily, too.

00:13:40.490 --> 00:13:41.680
I... see.

00:13:41.680 --> 00:13:43.100
What's up with you, Squid Girl?

00:13:43.100 --> 00:13:44.590
Your face is all red!

00:13:44.590 --> 00:13:46.090
Shut the squid up!

00:13:47.010 --> 00:13:49.040
Don't pick on me!

00:13:47.120 --> 00:13:51.540
Why wouldn't everyone love 
someone as nice as her?

00:13:49.040 --> 00:13:51.030
You're so cute!

00:13:51.030 --> 00:13:53.330
Even Kiyomi is being a squidding meanie!

00:13:53.330 --> 00:13:54.960
Nagisa loves her too.

00:13:55.370 --> 00:13:58.980
If she had really disliked her, 
she would've quit this job.

00:13:59.570 --> 00:14:04.570
Cindy and those three aren't 
rejecting her either.

00:14:05.650 --> 00:14:09.700
I guess I'm the only one who can't 
get my feelings across to her.

00:14:10.990 --> 00:14:14.420
Then again, the opposite 
of love isn't hate.

00:14:14.420 --> 00:14:15.940
It's indifference.

00:14:16.240 --> 00:14:17.380
That's right!

00:14:17.380 --> 00:14:20.400
If someone dislikes you, it means 
they still have an opinion about you.

00:14:21.090 --> 00:14:23.220
Don't praise me so much...

00:14:22.950 --> 00:14:26.980
But that doesn't mean I'm 
glad she dislikes me.

00:14:23.220 --> 00:14:24.670
What's wrong with it?

00:14:24.670 --> 00:14:26.980
It embarrasses me!

00:14:27.710 --> 00:14:30.840
So how do you feel about all of us?

00:14:32.610 --> 00:14:35.880
Well, I don't dislike you guys...

00:14:36.430 --> 00:14:38.060
Hey, what kind of answer is that!

00:14:38.450 --> 00:14:40.080
Come on, be honest.

00:14:40.080 --> 00:14:41.430
I just squidding told you!

00:14:41.650 --> 00:14:44.040
You guys aren't good or bad, I guess...

00:14:44.040 --> 00:14:45.530
I don't dislike you.

00:14:46.150 --> 00:14:49.370
So does that include me too?!

00:14:49.370 --> 00:14:50.020
I dislike you.

00:14:57.230 --> 00:14:59.370
...is something I wouldn't say.

00:14:59.700 --> 00:15:00.430
Squiddie!

00:15:00.430 --> 00:15:01.930
Wait no, I dislike you!

00:15:03.780 --> 00:15:05.740
...is something I wouldn't say.

00:15:05.740 --> 00:15:06.610
Squiddie!

00:15:06.610 --> 00:15:07.630
Actually...

00:15:08.330 --> 00:15:09.320
...or not...

00:15:09.970 --> 00:15:11.070
But then again!

00:15:12.080 --> 00:15:13.980
This is stupid.

00:15:14.340 --> 00:15:17.560
I'm sure Kiyomi and her friends 
think she's really creepy.

00:15:17.770 --> 00:15:20.440
You're really funny.

00:15:20.440 --> 00:15:21.240
Yeah!

00:15:21.720 --> 00:15:22.310
Huh?!

00:15:22.710 --> 00:15:23.720
Wait, no...

00:15:23.720 --> 00:15:24.730
But then again...

00:15:23.720 --> 00:15:27.870
I don't even want to imagine 
the relationship map for this.

00:15:24.730 --> 00:15:26.090
Maybe...

00:15:26.090 --> 00:15:27.730
Wait, I am sure.

00:15:28.400 --> 00:15:29.250
Oh, but...

00:15:29.420 --> 00:15:30.220
Actually...

00:15:33.780 --> 00:15:35.280
Oww!

00:15:35.780 --> 00:15:36.930
Are you all right?

00:15:36.930 --> 00:15:38.250
Let's go to the first aid booth!

00:15:39.590 --> 00:15:41.250
Is this for real?

00:15:41.460 --> 00:15:43.700
Look at that line!

00:15:44.220 --> 00:15:45.910
What's happening?

00:15:46.350 --> 00:15:48.650
What's going on today?

00:15:49.100 --> 00:15:51.680
There are a lot of jellyfish 
out there today.

00:15:51.990 --> 00:15:55.060
Be careful if you go into the water.

00:15:57.970 --> 00:16:00.110
Man, I'm worried.

00:16:00.480 --> 00:16:04.210
They might close the beach because of this.

00:16:06.030 --> 00:16:07.410
Serves you right!

00:16:07.410 --> 00:16:08.070
What?!

00:16:08.400 --> 00:16:10.570
This is happening because the humans

00:16:10.570 --> 00:16:14.950
go ahead and trample 
into our sacred seas.

00:16:15.370 --> 00:16:17.790
You could call this divine punishment!

00:16:18.180 --> 00:16:20.270
I'm going to join the good cause, too!

00:16:20.270 --> 00:16:21.460
Hey!

00:16:25.600 --> 00:16:27.230
I got a squiddle stung.

00:16:27.530 --> 00:16:28.460
You're pathetic.

00:16:29.080 --> 00:16:33.050
Those who cause harm without discrimination 
are nothing more than outlaws!

00:16:33.050 --> 00:16:35.740
I'll squidding show them!

00:16:36.140 --> 00:16:37.710
That's great.

00:16:38.290 --> 00:16:43.100
<b>Making A Few Squid With Jellyfish</b>

00:16:50.480 --> 00:16:52.840
There really are a lot 
of jellyfish out here.

00:16:53.090 --> 00:16:55.160
How many of these are there?!

00:16:55.950 --> 00:16:57.310
Hey Goro.

00:16:57.970 --> 00:16:59.370
Oh, it's you, Squid.

00:16:59.730 --> 00:17:02.550
Are you collecting jellyfish too?

00:17:03.120 --> 00:17:04.390
Of course.

00:17:04.390 --> 00:17:07.250
It's my job to keep the ocean safe.

00:17:11.330 --> 00:17:14.580
You expect to keep the 
ocean safe like that?

00:17:14.580 --> 00:17:15.510
Shut up!

00:17:15.510 --> 00:17:17.390
You've got your tentacles to help you!

00:17:18.780 --> 00:17:22.460
Look at this bag full of jellyfish I've got!

00:17:28.760 --> 00:17:30.820
Oww!

00:17:30.820 --> 00:17:34.070
Of course it'll burst if you stuff 
that many into one bag.

00:17:35.550 --> 00:17:37.970
Well, thanks for collecting 
the jellyfish.

00:17:37.970 --> 00:17:39.200
It really helps.

00:17:39.780 --> 00:17:41.460
Just don't hurt yourself, okay?

00:17:41.460 --> 00:17:43.110
Wait!

00:17:43.860 --> 00:17:48.920
How about we have a 
jellyfish collecting competition?

00:17:49.830 --> 00:17:50.680
A competition?

00:17:51.010 --> 00:17:51.920
Why would I do something as petty as--

00:17:51.920 --> 00:17:55.340
Would you mind if I organized 
that competition?

00:17:55.760 --> 00:17:56.840
Chizuru!

00:17:57.930 --> 00:18:02.620
This many jellyfish can't be 
handled by one or two people.

00:18:02.620 --> 00:18:06.440
Why don't we make it a competition 
and have everyone help out?

00:18:02.840 --> 00:18:06.440
Jellyfish Collecting Competition

00:18:08.420 --> 00:18:11.340
Jellyfish Collecting Competition

00:18:11.850 --> 00:18:15.240
I'd like to thank everyone for coming out today.

00:18:15.260 --> 00:18:19.740
1st Place: Yakisoba for a year
 2nd Place: Oden Kit
3rd Place: Analog TV

00:18:16.200 --> 00:18:19.280
We've got some fantastic 
prizes for the winners.

00:18:20.220 --> 00:18:21.370
And so, without further ado:

00:18:21.370 --> 00:18:24.160
On your mark... get set... go!

00:18:27.670 --> 00:18:28.340
Here's one!

00:18:28.340 --> 00:18:29.210
All right!

00:18:31.150 --> 00:18:32.050
I did it!

00:18:32.050 --> 00:18:33.050
Wow!

00:18:33.880 --> 00:18:34.640
Over there!

00:18:36.790 --> 00:18:38.170
Squid Girlie...

00:18:38.170 --> 00:18:41.140
That's not fair, we found it first!

00:18:41.270 --> 00:18:44.600
You're doing all right for humans.

00:18:44.940 --> 00:18:48.400
But in order to make 
you acknowledge me as

00:18:48.400 --> 00:18:50.000
the invader from the sea,

00:18:50.320 --> 00:18:54.480
I'll have to win by 
a crushing landslide!

00:18:54.580 --> 00:18:57.160
I found one... hey!

00:18:57.660 --> 00:18:59.830
There's a lot of them over there!

00:18:59.830 --> 00:19:00.700
All right.

00:19:02.950 --> 00:19:04.790
This squid is taking them all!

00:19:06.880 --> 00:19:08.930
Looks like I got caught on something.

00:19:16.890 --> 00:19:18.970
Wait, where are you going?

00:19:18.970 --> 00:19:20.130
Stop!

00:19:25.950 --> 00:19:27.910
What is she doing?

00:19:28.230 --> 00:19:29.380
It looks like fun.

00:19:29.790 --> 00:19:31.760
She's so cute.

00:19:31.760 --> 00:19:34.110
What the heck are you 
doing here, anyway?

00:19:34.480 --> 00:19:36.890
Have you even caught a single jellyfish?

00:19:36.890 --> 00:19:38.850
Oh, that's no problem.

00:19:39.560 --> 00:19:41.520
Excuse me...

00:19:41.820 --> 00:19:43.070
Y-yes.

00:19:43.490 --> 00:19:45.590
Can I buy those jellyfish from you?

00:19:45.590 --> 00:19:46.390
Hey!

00:19:52.110 --> 00:19:53.290
Time's up!

00:19:54.790 --> 00:19:56.790
Thank you all for your help!

00:19:57.200 --> 00:19:59.740
Feel free to take a break 
while we tally the results.

00:20:01.890 --> 00:20:04.490
That accident was unfortunate,

00:20:05.300 --> 00:20:08.130
but I've got a whole school more since then!

00:20:13.620 --> 00:20:16.860
Doesn't look like you 
had much of a haul.

00:20:17.320 --> 00:20:19.820
There's not a squid of a chance 
I'm losing to you, Goro.

00:20:20.890 --> 00:20:21.860
I guess.

00:20:23.020 --> 00:20:25.290
It doesn't really matter 
who won or lost.

00:20:26.090 --> 00:20:29.860
What's important is that 
we all came together

00:20:29.860 --> 00:20:31.230
to make the ocean safe.

00:20:33.200 --> 00:20:35.490
How dare you act all high and mighty?

00:20:35.490 --> 00:20:38.990
Nobody loves the sea more than I do!

00:20:39.270 --> 00:20:40.340
What's that about?

00:20:42.220 --> 00:20:44.680
We'd like to thank you 
all for your patience.

00:20:45.210 --> 00:20:49.830
We've finished tallying and 
will now announce the results.

00:20:50.970 --> 00:20:53.360
The winner of the jellyfish 
collecting competition...

00:20:53.710 --> 00:20:54.730
Is me, of course.

00:20:55.750 --> 00:20:57.630
...is Cindy and the Three Stooges!

00:20:57.630 --> 00:20:59.170
Thank you!

00:20:59.170 --> 00:20:59.980
We did it!

00:21:04.220 --> 00:21:07.800
How were you possibly able 
to collect this many?

00:21:08.140 --> 00:21:12.290
You used some kind of weird 
machine again, didn't you?

00:21:12.290 --> 00:21:14.580
It's not like we've collected that many.

00:21:14.970 --> 00:21:15.930
Yes!

00:21:15.930 --> 00:21:19.040
We graduated top of the class from MIT!

00:21:19.300 --> 00:21:21.420
We did nothing but study.

00:21:21.680 --> 00:21:23.800
We're too weak to do exercise!

00:21:24.230 --> 00:21:26.360
We're runts!

00:21:26.360 --> 00:21:27.680
It's not something to be proud of.

00:21:28.270 --> 00:21:30.140
This is how we did it.

00:21:30.410 --> 00:21:33.560
First, we capture one jellyfish.

00:21:33.560 --> 00:21:34.650
Oh, yeah!

00:21:34.650 --> 00:21:38.860
Jelly jellyfish, let's go!

00:21:36.170 --> 00:21:38.860
Then we drop it on the ground.

00:21:38.860 --> 00:21:40.860
Yes! Yes!

00:21:39.890 --> 00:21:40.600
Huh?

00:21:41.210 --> 00:21:47.110
Then we used this multiplier 
ray gun to increase their numbers!

00:21:48.790 --> 00:21:49.790
Bravo!

00:21:50.740 --> 00:21:51.950
Fantastic!

00:21:52.550 --> 00:21:54.710
So that's how they squidding did it.

00:21:56.400 --> 00:21:58.880
How do you like our science?!

00:22:00.620 --> 00:22:02.380
What the hell were you thinking, 
increasing their numbers?

00:22:02.380 --> 00:22:04.550
You're in charge of getting rid of them!

00:22:04.550 --> 00:22:05.770
Got it?

00:22:06.440 --> 00:22:09.010
I guess cheating is never right.

00:23:41.240 --> 00:23:44.160
I am the messenger from 
the sea, Squid Girl.

00:23:44.160 --> 00:23:45.110
Next time is...

00:23:45.110 --> 00:23:46.700
Shall We Swim To An Elementary School?!

00:23:46.700 --> 00:23:47.900
Squid In Cosplay?!

00:23:47.900 --> 00:23:49.230
Squidn't You Lose A Little Weight?!

00:23:49.230 --> 00:23:50.640
All three!

00:23:50.640 --> 00:23:53.250
I'm going to squid-vade you all again!
